msgid "Classic AI is the original’s own computer. The others play by Hyperion’s rules: StarCraft II’s levels, Very Easy to Elite, from slower and smaller to faster, and the Cheater levels, which play as Elite and cheat as StarCraft II’s do. Vision sees the whole map; resources sees it too and brings back more from each trip, growing to half as much again by 20 minutes; insane brings back a fifth more from the start, growing to twice as much."
msgstr "“经典”就是原版自带的电脑。其余难度使用 Hyperion 的规则：StarCraft II 的难度，从“非常简单”到“精英”，由慢而小逐步变快，以及“作弊者”难度，它们的打法与“精英”相同，作弊方式与 StarCraft II 的一致。视野：看得到整个地图；资源：同样看得到整个地图，而且每趟采集带回更多资源，到 20 分钟时增至一点五倍；疯狂：从一开始就多带回五分之一，并逐渐增至两倍。"

