msgstr "继续"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_settings.cpp:1815
msgid "Every setting on this tab goes back to its default. The other tabs keep theirs."
msgstr "这个选项卡上的所有设置都会恢复默认。其他选项卡不受影响。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_settings.cpp:1824
